Sun Oct 25 13:30:00 UTC 2026 - Rodrigo Brito <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Ship /usr/lib/modprobe.d/60-lyra-nvidia-pm.conf with
  NVreg_DynamicPowerManagement=0x02 (fine-grained runtime D3). The
  driver default disables RTD3 on pre-Ampere notebooks; on the GTX 1650
  Mobile reference the idle dGPU now suspends (vegad#78).

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Mon Oct 13 16:30:00 UTC 2026 - Rodrigo Brito <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Update to 615.71.09, matching vegad distro.NvidiaVersion.
  Leap 16.1 OSS now ships only the SUSE-signed KMP
  nvidia-open-driver-G07-signed-cuda-kmp-default 615.71.09 for kernel
  6.12.0-160100.7; the 610.57.04 KMP was removed, so the previous
  profile could no longer be installed on an up-to-date system.
- Move the package source into the vegad repository
  (packaging/lyra-nvidia) so daemon and profile are bumped together.

